        "body": "<div>Booked by David Cox dcox@endicott.edu Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting. The research in my lab focuses on the intersection of behavior science and data science. So, we don't have specific projects, per se, that I have ready and am seeking a platform for. Rather, I am looking for possibilities for projects on the horizon and am comparing prices and functionality. I know this doesn't help build a specific quote. But, any ballpark estimates would be useful as I submit grant (and other) funding requests.</div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<div> </div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid 1px #dadce0; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:28px;\">\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"></a><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; padding: 10px 25px; border: none; margin: 0;\">Join with Google Meet</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Meeting link</h2></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij</a></div>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/evj-xfps-nij?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">Test your setup</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">any time before your appointment.</span>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\">New to Google Meet?</div>\n<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">about getting started.</span>\n</div>\n<br><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Join by phone</h2></td></tr></table>\n<span style=\"color: #70757a;\">(US) </span><a href=\"tel:+1-405-355-2240%3B678667149%23\">+1 405-355-2240</a> <br><span style=\"color: #70757a;\">PIN: 678667149</span><br><br><a href=\"https://tel.meet/evj-xfps-nij?pin=6719705127058&amp;hs=0\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://tel.meet/evj-xfps-nij?pin=6719705127058&amp;hs=0\" target=\"_blank\">More phone numbers</a><br>\n</div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-right: 32px; padding-left: 0;width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0; vertical-align:top;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">Meeting with Avicenna (Amin Tavassolian) (David Cox)</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">\n<span><time datetime=\"20240923T140000Z\"></time><time datetime=\"20240923T143000Z\"></time></span>Monday Sep 23, 2024 ⋅ 7am – 7:30am (Pacific Time - Los Angeles) </div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\"><span><b>Booked by</b><br>David Cox<br><a href=\"mailto:dcox@endicott.edu\">dcox@endicott.edu</a><br><br><b>Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting.</b><br>The research in my lab focuses on the intersection of behavior science and data science. So, we don't have specific projects, per se, that I have ready and am seeking a platform for. Rather, I am looking for possibilities for projects on the horizon and am comparing prices and functionality. I know this doesn't help build a specific quote. But, any ballpark estimates would be useful as I submit grant (and other) funding requests.</span></div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding:4px 12px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"color: #70757a;\">\n<p>Powered by <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Calendar appointment scheduling</a>. Use is subject to the <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Google Privacy Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<p>You are receiving this email because you are included on the guest list for this booked appointment.</p>\n<p>Forwarding this invitation could allow any recipient to cancel on your behalf.</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
